.nh
.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-duo \- Work with GitLab Duo.


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab duo [command] [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Use the GitLab Duo Agent Platform in your terminal. Ask GitLab Duo questions about your codebase and use it to autonomously perform actions on your behalf.

.PP
\fBglab duo cli\fR installs and runs the GitLab Duo CLI (\fBduo\fR) binary. \fBglab\fR handles authentication, so you sign in only once with \fBglab auth login\fR\&.

.PP
The GitLab Duo CLI requires GitLab 19.2 or later, or GitLab 18.11 to 19.1 with beta and experimental features turned on. For all prerequisites and usage, see \fBglab duo cli --help\fR\&.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
glab duo cli --install
glab duo cli
glab duo cli run --goal "Fix the failing tests in this project"
.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBglab(1)\fP, \fBglab-duo-cli(1)\fP
